superfile (1.6.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Recommend xdg-utils, for opening files.
  * Suggest ca-certificates, for the update check, and the tools previews,
    the metadata and zoxide plugins and the clipboard use: bat, ffmpeg,
    ghostscript, libimage-exiftool-perl, poppler-utils, zoxide, and
    wl-clipboard or xclip or xsel.

